OL,3,GNEWSAColleges to be made independent to
OL,4,Aaccept donation                        
OL,6,FDeputies have voted to make two        
OL,7,Fcolleges independent so they can accept
OL,8,Fan anonymous substantial donation.     
OL,10,FThe offer was conditional on the       
OL,11,Findependence of Elizabeth College and  
OL,12,FLadies' College in Guernsey, and would 
OL,13,Fallow them to give up their annual     
OL,14,Fgrants from the States which total     
OL,15,F#2.2m.                                 
OL,17,FDaniele Harford-Fox and Jenny Palmer,  
OL,18,Fprincipals of The Ladies' College and  
OL,19,FElizabeth College respectively, said   
OL,20,Fthey were delighted by the decision and
OL,21,Fwere grateful to the States of         
OL,22,FGuernsey.                              
